synonym: "Abnormal movement of the globe of the eye" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormal ocular movements" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of eye movement" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Eye movement abnormalities" EXACT layperson []
